{
  "$comment": "Explicit non-journal archive adapters; source registration remains in sources.json. HTML page/date selectors and ITDP RSS pagination verified against publisher listings on 2026-10-10. The 24 rules added on 2026-10-15 attach back-paginated listings to sources that were already registered: `config: {}` deliberately reuses each source's own live itemSelector/publishedAtSelector, so the rule only carries the URL shape. Each one was then re-measured on the production collector with `backfill-news.ts --max-pages=2`; two candidates were dropped before shipping because the listing parses on a laptop but not here (igg.cas.cn returned 41 candidates with 37 undated, geosphere.at 23 with 15 undated) — an undated row can never be published, so a rule that cannot date its rows is worse than no rule. This is not a universal archive for all sources.",
  "archives": [
    {
      "sourceId": "rss-itdp-news",
      "mode": "pages",
      "format": "rss",
      "urlTemplate": "https://www.itdp.org/feed/?paged={page}",
      "firstPage": 1,
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "web-wmo-news",
